    "northStar": "Meja urus setia",
    "overview": "User-approved direction: Formal, ringkas dan berorientasikan kerja. The historical mockup portal and coordinator workspace use Operate mode: registers, ownership, dates and next actions provide the hierarchy. The Laravel public landing is a scoped corporate variant. Workspace and historical mockup tokens remain intact.",
